sequenceDiagram
  participant Shop
  participant Payments
  actor Bank
  Shop->>Payments: create charge
  loop retry window
    Payments->>Bank: authorize
    Bank-->>Payments: temporary decline
  end
  Payments->>Bank: authorize
  Bank-->>Payments: approved
  Payments-->>Shop: charge captured
  Note right of Payments: idempotency key reused
